{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15208180","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15208180","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1520818001:1":{"text":"欧布，费斗，你们刚才做得很好。","source_cn":"欧布，费斗，你们刚才做得很好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD8F7658776F5A59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520818002:1":{"text":"但你们似乎忘了，这是一场比赛。","source_cn":"但你们似乎忘了，这是一场比赛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9D1C481FBCC5187","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520818003:0":{"text":"不，我们没忘！","source_cn":"不，我们没忘！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E71D303AF9B70AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520818004:0":{"text":"即使把这只算作费斗的猎物，我用箭杀死的野狼也一定比他用矛杀死的更多！","source_cn":"即使把这只算作费斗的猎物，我用箭杀死的野狼也一定比他用...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA06CA28E43653CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520818005:0":{"text":"如果阿爹你不信，就尽管去数一数！","source_cn":"如果阿爹你不信，就尽管去数一数！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD817DF353F401AD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1520818006:1":{"text":"要是你这么有能耐，为什么